<rte name="Estimating Considerations" id="com.ey.task.estimate" nodeId="4a011b3e">The amount of preparation varies from project to project; however, it is highly advised that the Development Team perform a
dry run of the sprint review in the exact same conditions.&amp;nbsp;Typically, no more than one hour of preparation is needed
for a two week long sprint.</rte>
